body='<h1>M04-S2 HOST IO-health 安全閘門提案</h1><p>建議A的精確化子包，仍未批准。明列完整recovery lifecycle的架構缺口；不是可實作完整S2 envelope。</p><pre>'+html.escape(spec['architecture']['hexagonal']+'\n'+spec['architecture']['dependency'])+'</pre><h2>契約</h2>'+''.join('<p><b>'+a+' '+b+'</b><br>'+html.escape(c)+'</p>' for a,b,c in rules)+'<h2>操作矩陣</h2><table>'+''.join('<tr><td>'+a+'</td><td>'+b+'</td><td>'+c+'</td></tr>' for a,b,c in operations)+'</table><h2>必要架構決策</h2><p>Runtime-only block不能冒充跨重啟安全。需補target identity／startup／unblock的proof-bearing契約；不能讀寫IO私有journal或重建DocumentSession繞過。此缺口只阻擋受影響recovery整合，不是全域停工。</p><h2>BDD／TDD與驗證</h2><p>13項計畫案例，全部NOT RUN；796產品來源、branch／HEAD一致，無Skeleton／產品修改。父M04 PREP仍黃；先整合SP/R2/HG與caller精確包。</p>'
